# .gitignore —— 本仓库的忽略规则：Nix 构建产物、home-manager 备份、
# 编辑器临时文件与机密文件（真实 secrets.env 在仓库外，防止误拷入提交）。
# Nix build results
/result
/result-*

# home-manager backups of pre-existing files
*.hm-bak

# Editor
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Secrets (Vault/env files). The live file is ~/.config/zsh/secrets.env, outside
# this repo; this pattern prevents an accidental copy from being committed.
secrets.env
*.secret
*.secrets
